_on_customer_202607101944.mp4","file":"assets/14_vision-pro/Employee_fits_headset_on_customer_202607101944.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was an illusion, almost managed by a new kind of clinical corporate power.","kw":["illusion","almost","managed","kind","clinical","corporate","power"],"ch":14},{"t":11.04,"dur":5,"clip":"13_open-standard/Participant_speaking_at_workshop_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Participant_speaking_at_workshop_202607101943.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"But the code had already begun to rewrite power.","kw":["code","already","begun","rewrite","power"],"ch":13},{"t":19.11,"dur":7,"clip":"12_consumer-vr/Hand_reaching_invisible_control_…_202607101903.mp4","file":"assets/12_consumer-vr/Hand_reaching_invisible_control_…_202607101903.mp4","in":0,"text":"We began to gesture at ghosts in the air, believing we were still in control.","kw":["began","gesture","ghosts","believing","still","control"],"ch":12},{"t":27.18,"dur":7,"clip":"11_oculus/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101902_3.mp4","file":"assets/11_oculus/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101902_3.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the moment we began to migrate into the simulated world.","kw":["moment","began","migrate","simulated","world"],"ch":11},{"t":35.85,"dur":5.6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","in":0,"text":"Imagine stepping completely inside your favorite video games. This is not science fiction. This is reality.","kw":["imagine","stepping","completely","inside","your","favorite","video","games"],"ch":10},{"t":43.56,"dur":3.14,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","in":6.52,"text":"Just step inside one of these futuristic pods.","kw":["just","step","inside","these","futuristic","pods"],"ch":9},{"t":51.39,"dur":7,"clip":"08_vpl/People_wearing_HMDs_DataGloves_202607101938.mp4","file":"assets/08_vpl/People_wearing_HMDs_DataGloves_202607101938.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1987, scientists believed they could create a new world, a shared space beyond physical reality.","kw":["scientists","believed","could","create","world","shared","space","beyond"],"ch":8},{"t":59.72,"dur":5,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher's_eyes_reflected_HMD_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher's_eyes_reflected_HMD_202607101936.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"We created a new kind of void, a space where everything could be programmed.","kw":["created","kind","void","space","where","everything","could","programmed"],"ch":7},{"t":67.53,"dur":6,"clip":"06_public-grid/AI_presenter_describes_electroni…_202607101856.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/AI_presenter_describes_electroni…_202607101856.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"It must be treated as a true civic utility for everyone.","kw":["must","treated","true","civic","utility","everyone"],"ch":6},{"t":75.6,"dur":6,"clip":"05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They wanted to map the human mind, to connect the brain directly to a digital world.","kw":["wanted","human","mind","connect","brain","directly","digital","world"],"ch":5},{"t":83.96,"dur":6,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Television_weather_map_graphics_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Television_weather_map_graphics_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the moment when we began to believe that the entire world could be managed by data.","kw":["moment","when","began","believe","entire","world","could","managed"],"ch":4},{"t":91.75,"dur":6.6,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","in":0,"text":"The Censorama offers a fully integrated experience, with simulated wind and aroma to enhanc